# The browser uses same-origin /api requests. No frontend secrets are required.
# Configure the Node.js backend using ../backend/.env.example.
# Development API proxy target is configured in vite.config.ts.
# Vercel: vercel.json proxies /api to https://backend-eosin-zeta-63.vercel.app.
# No VITE_API_URL is needed for that same-origin setup.
# Set MONGODB_URI and APP_ORIGIN only in the backend Vercel project's settings.
